So as you can see, if you are a
customer who has a data science

00:41:09.770 --> 00:41:11.540
expertise in-house,
you can directly

00:41:11.540 --> 00:41:14.300
use our products as is.

00:41:14.300 --> 00:41:16.250
If you want to build
an end to end solution,

00:41:16.250 --> 00:41:20.080
you can work with our
SI partners such as PwC

00:41:20.080 --> 00:41:22.580
